msgstr "CZ/SK dohadné položky (odhady)"

#. module: l10n_cssk_accrual
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_accrual/models/cssk_accrual_estimate.py:0
msgid ""
"Cannot reverse accrual %(name)s on %(date)s: that date falls in a locked "
"period (%(locks)s). Adjust the lock date or use a later reversal date."
msgstr ""
"Dohadnú položku %(name)s nemožno stornovať k %(date)s: tento dátum "
"spadá do uzamknutého obdobia (%(locks)s). Upravte dátum uzamknutia "
"alebo použite neskorší dátum storna."

#. module: l10n_cssk_accrual
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_l10n_cssk_accrual
msgid ""
"Estimated unbilled items — book an estimate to the accrual account (CZ "
"388/389, SK 326), then link the actual invoice to true it up."
msgstr ""
"Odhad nevyfakturovaných položiek — zaúčtujte odhad na účet dohadných "
"položiek (CZ 388/389, SK 326) a následne naň naviažte skutočnú "
"faktúru na dorovnanie."

#. module: l10n_cssk_accrual
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_accrual/models/cssk_accrual_estimate.py:0
msgid ""
"Only a draft or posted estimate can be cancelled (%(name)s is %(state)s)."
msgstr ""
"Zrušiť možno len odhad v stave návrh alebo zaúčtovaný (%(name)s je "
"%(state)s)."

#. module: l10n_cssk_accrual
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_accrual/models/cssk_accrual_estimate.py:0
msgid ""
"The accrual account %(account)s of %(name)s must allow reconciliation, "
"otherwise the estimate cannot be cleared against its reversal when settled."
msgstr ""
"Účet dohadných položiek %(account)s záznamu %(name)s musí povoľovať "
"párovanie, inak nemožno odhad pri vysporiadaní spárovať s jeho "
"stornom."

#. module: l10n_cssk_accrual
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_accrual/models/cssk_accrual_estimate.py:0
msgid ""
"The accrual line of %(name)s on account %(account)s is already reconciled "
"(moves: %(moves)s). Unreconcile it first if you really want to reverse this "
"estimate."
msgstr ""
"Riadok dohadnej položky %(name)s na účte %(account)s je už spárovaný "
"(doklady: %(moves)s). Ak naozaj chcete tento odhad stornovať, najprv "
"zrušte párovanie."